# Build-context whitelist (tools/container/README.md §2/§4/§8): the staged
# context carries only what the Dockerfile COPYs — the Dockerfile, the two
# binaries (hongscanner + collector), serve.py, cloud_supervisor.py, the
# collector sidecar and its pinned requirements, the four notify modules
# and the calendar INDEX.
# Everything else is excluded. In particular the real calendars/*.json are
# gitignored user data and never enter an image or a build context; only
# the git-tracked calendars/CALENDAR_INDEX.sha256 passes. No credential
# (APP_KEY_MOCK / APP_SECRET_MOCK / FCM service-account JSON) has a
# whitelist entry: secrets are runtime Northflank Secret Group injections.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!bin
bin/*
!bin/hongscanner
!bin/collector
!tools
tools/*
!tools/api
tools/api/*
!tools/api/serve.py
!tools/collector
tools/collector/*
!tools/collector/sidecar.py
!tools/collector/requirements.txt
!tools/notify
tools/notify/*
!tools/notify/notify_dispatcher.py
!tools/notify/notify_config.py
!tools/notify/notify_fcm.py
!tools/notify/notify_ledger.py
!tools/container
tools/container/*
!tools/container/cloud_supervisor.py
!calendars
calendars/*
!calendars/CALENDAR_INDEX.sha256
